# Frontend (Vite) — copied to .env.local or passed at build time.
# Where the Conduit backend lives.
#   - Leave empty (default) to talk to the SAME origin (dev Vite proxy, or the
#     nginx proxy in deploy/nginx.conf).
#   - Set an absolute URL to hit the backend directly from another origin,
#     e.g. https://api.conduit.example.com (the backend already sends CORS headers).
# WebSocket URLs are derived from this automatically (https -> wss).
VITE_API_BASE=

# Backend (server/.env.example) — PORT, HOST, DATABASE_URL
